lator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and October to November came in under 90% of normal in 38 of them on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids. In 2025 that pair ran 41% of normal on the middle, and November to December ran 43%. So far in 2026, March to April sits at 38% of normal on the county&rsquo;s middle value. Grid 20000 had its driest year in 1963 at 67% of normal.</p>"}
